    "directions": [
      "Heat oil in kadhai and add cumin seeds and peppercorns. Saute onions and ginger garlic paste until turns golden brown in color.",
      "Now add chicken and add turmeric, salt and saute for 3-4 minutes.",
      "Add red chili powder, coriander powder and coconut milk. Cover and allow it to cook.",
      "Add little water if required.",
      "When chicken is cooked remove and serve immediately with roti or steamed rice."
